Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 20:31:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] remotes: follow bounded referrers pagination

Follow same-origin OCI referrers pagination links while preserving repository-scoped filters and authorization. Bound pages, decoded bytes, and descriptors, stream descriptor decoding, and reject loops or endpoint changes.

